{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Rot awakens!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953480/extras/cdf421e6c13f97a661fc254e886adf11.avif?t=1755852922\" width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Desperate Survivors</strong> who are discovering the unknown origins of the Rot to hopefully stop the End Times. Pair up with up to 3 friends in this Multiplayer Horde Shooter to fight off waves of the Rot, utilizing WW2-inspired weaponry and powerful ancient artifacts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blockifiers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are these Tetris-like pieces?!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953480/extras/0ba5f7117846e0bc6e530cdfd29f7036.poster.avif?t=1755852922\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953480/extras/0ba5f7117846e0bc6e530cdfd29f7036.webm?t=1755852922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953480/extras/0ba5f7117846e0bc6e530cdfd29f7036.mp4?t=1755852922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are Powerful Modifiers that slot into your Guns! They drastically alter the way your Weapon Functions, from gunning out electrifying arcs to converting your Sniper Rifle into a High Powered LMG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the perfect combination of crazy Blockifiers to put an end to the Rot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953480/extras/a49ba0cc4ffbeb5fe12912933e7b687e.poster.avif?t=1755852922\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953480/extras/a49ba0cc4ffbeb5fe12912933e7b687e.webm?t=1755852922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953480/extras/a49ba0cc4ffbeb5fe12912933e7b687e.mp4?t=1755852922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953480?t=1755852922","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953480?t=1755852922","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953480/1c35d927478600be1fbbd6134f434651a47a8b1c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755852922","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953480/1c35d927478600be1fbbd6134f434651a47a8b1c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755852922","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Rotten contains strong language, intense violence, blood and gore, as well as nudity and sexual material."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Rot awakens!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953480/extras/cdf421e6c13f97a661fc254e886adf11.avif?t=1755852922\" width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Desperate Survivors</strong> who are discovering the unknown origins of the Rot to hopefully stop the End Times. Pair up with up to 3 friends in this Multiplayer Horde Shooter to fight off waves of the Rot, utilizing WW2-inspired weaponry and powerful ancient artifacts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blockifiers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are these Tetris-like pieces?!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953480/extras/0ba5f7117846e0bc6e530cdfd29f7036.poster.avif?t=1755852922\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953480/extras/0ba5f7117846e0bc6e530cdfd29f7036.webm?t=1755852922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953480/extras/0ba5f7117846e0bc6e530cdfd29f7036.mp4?t=1755852922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are Powerful Modifiers that slot into your Guns! They drastically alter the way your Weapon Functions, from gunning out electrifying arcs to converting your Sniper Rifle into a High Powered LMG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the perfect combination of crazy Blockifiers to put an end to the Rot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953480/extras/a49ba0cc4ffbeb5fe12912933e7b687e.poster.avif?t=1755852922\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953480/extras/a49ba0cc4ffbeb5fe12912933e7b687e.webm?t=1755852922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953480/extras/a49ba0cc4ffbeb5fe12912933e7b687e.mp4?t=1755852922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["House of Rot Games LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description"